WEBVTT

00:07.940 --> 00:09.400
<i>Checkmate!</i>

00:10.940 --> 00:12.400
The painting is gone!

00:12.780 --> 00:15.740
Don't let her get away! Chase her!!

00:20.700 --> 00:21.700
This way!

00:21.700 --> 00:23.700
Hurry!

00:24.960 --> 00:26.880
Damn! Where did she go?

00:29.000 --> 00:30.000
There she goes!

00:38.470 --> 00:40.970
Chase her! Catch her!

00:44.230 --> 00:47.650
Tonight, I've once again stolen a deceptive beauty!

00:53.360 --> 00:56.660
Crap! We lost her again!

00:56.660 --> 00:58.740
Kaitou Jeanne...

01:08.290 --> 01:11.420
The shining time...

01:12.550 --> 01:20.180
...I have always imagined.

01:29.150 --> 01:34.280
Something will change tomorrow.

01:36.360 --> 01:42.620
I can sense it.

01:43.790 --> 01:50.920
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

01:51.210 --> 01:58.890
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

01:59.760 --> 02:05.850
You've run so far.

02:06.930 --> 02:14.110
So I felt the air of your love.

02:14.320 --> 02:20.320
Soon after I see you,

02:21.700 --> 02:27.620
my stolen heart beats.

02:41.840 --> 02:47.480
Phantom Thief Comes with Notice

03:04.580 --> 03:05.910
I'm sorry I'm late!

03:05.910 --> 03:06.990
Maron!

03:10.370 --> 03:12.330
Why'd you do that, Miyako?

03:12.330 --> 03:13.670
I'm taking it out on you.

03:13.670 --> 03:14.340
Eh?

03:14.790 --> 03:19.170
She got away again last night! That Kaitou Jeanne...

03:20.720 --> 03:23.510
Even so, it's unfair 'cause I'm just here to practice.

03:23.510 --> 03:28.640
You know, the freshmen have to arrange stuff before practice.

03:28.640 --> 03:31.390
But I just want to practice.

03:31.390 --> 03:35.690
You can't break the traditional rules! Obey the rules!

03:35.690 --> 03:37.780
Rules are made to be broken.

03:37.780 --> 03:39.570
I like freedom.

03:39.570 --> 03:45.620
Freedom only exists within the rules. Breaking the rules is what Kaitou Jeanne does!

03:46.870 --> 03:48.580
Hey, Miyako.

03:48.580 --> 03:55.130
You should stop going to crime scenes with your dad, even if he is a detective.

03:55.130 --> 04:00.920
No way. I'm going to be a detective someday, like my dad. I need to know the basics.

04:01.300 --> 04:02.720
<i>She's so stubborn.</i>

04:04.300 --> 04:07.760
I won't stop until I catch Kaitou Jeanne.

04:07.760 --> 04:12.640
Why are you so obsessed with her? There are lots of other thieves.

04:13.020 --> 04:15.350
I'll never forgive Jeanne!

04:15.350 --> 04:17.520
You're such a play-by-the-rules woman!

04:17.520 --> 04:19.820
What?! You're such a break-the-rules woman!

04:19.820 --> 04:22.780
- I just worry about you!

04:21.490 --> 04:22.780
- You don't have to!

04:29.120 --> 04:31.250
Pakkyamlamao-sensei!

04:31.250 --> 04:33.330
What the heck are you two doing?

04:33.330 --> 04:36.630
Gymnastics must be performed with a heart like a beautiful flower.

04:36.630 --> 04:39.710
You can't excel with a barren heart.

04:39.710 --> 04:40.920
Yes, ma'am.

04:41.130 --> 04:43.170
So, which one of you is at fault?

04:43.630 --> 04:45.130
- Maron!

04:43.630 --> 04:45.130
- Miyako!

04:47.800 --> 04:49.430
Get out, both of you!

04:54.810 --> 04:57.480
Hey, don't follow me!

04:58.110 --> 04:59.570
What?!

04:59.570 --> 05:03.070
I have to. We live in the same apartment complex, and the doors are facing each other!

05:04.780 --> 05:08.570
Sensei scolded us, and nothing good happens whenever I'm with you.

05:09.450 --> 05:10.790
"Nothing good...?!"

05:24.840 --> 05:28.180
Maron! What do you mean by "nothing good?!"

05:28.680 --> 05:30.300
I mean, you're the worst!

05:30.300 --> 05:32.100
You make me mad!

05:35.310 --> 05:37.140
You're right. Nothing good happens to me.

05:37.140 --> 05:38.600
That doesn't apply to you!

05:39.110 --> 05:43.820
After all, it's the fault of whoever stacked these things here. Who did that?

05:46.990 --> 05:49.160
It was me. Sorry about that.

05:59.790 --> 06:05.420
The apartment regulations prohibit leaving trash in the lobby and corridors. Move them now--

06:05.420 --> 06:07.630
I like a talkative girl.

06:07.930 --> 06:08.800
Huh?

06:09.760 --> 06:12.510
I like you better when you're quiet.

06:14.720 --> 06:17.230
Oh, I like you, too.

06:18.480 --> 06:21.150
Especially because of the nice view...

06:30.070 --> 06:31.450
What a jerk!

06:31.450 --> 06:33.950
He should have pretended not to have noticed.

06:33.950 --> 06:35.620
Who does he think he is?!

06:35.620 --> 06:39.620
The boxes were all empty... Maybe he just moved in?

06:40.120 --> 06:44.380
If so, that's even worse! Right, Miyako?

06:48.970 --> 06:51.930
Oh, Miyako. Welcome home.

06:53.350 --> 06:54.310
Huh?

07:02.940 --> 07:06.400
Miyako sure seemed distracted. What the heck...

07:07.780 --> 07:10.570
...will be held on the 20th of this month.

07:10.570 --> 07:12.110
<i>In other news...</i>

07:12.740 --> 07:19.870
<i>Artist Yujiro Yamakawa's paintings were again ruined with black paint last night.</i>

07:19.870 --> 07:23.330
<i>Yamakawa is one of the most prominent artists in Japan.</i>

07:23.330 --> 07:27.590
<i>His most famous quote is: "Beautiful pictures exist only in beautiful hearts."</i>

07:27.590 --> 07:30.680
<i>Why does the suspect keep targeting Yamakawa's works?</i>

07:30.680 --> 07:33.260
<i>Does the suspect have a grudge against him?</i>

07:47.940 --> 07:53.320
<i>Even though the police have launched an intense investigation, no clues have been found so far.</i>

08:06.130 --> 08:07.590
Ah! I found it!

08:17.180 --> 08:22.560
No! Don't enter my soul!

08:42.000 --> 08:43.710
Oh no! This isn't good...

08:49.170 --> 08:50.590
Here you go!

08:56.340 --> 09:02.930
<i>"I will steal your famous painting, 'Beauty in the Green Light,' at 8:00 P.M. tomorrow night." - Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne</i>

09:16.360 --> 09:19.120
Hello! I'm home, Maron.

09:19.120 --> 09:20.410
Welcome home, Fin.

09:20.410 --> 09:22.950
I'll give it to you straight. You've got your next job--

09:22.950 --> 09:24.080
No way!

09:24.710 --> 09:26.330
Why?

09:26.330 --> 09:31.340
I just did one yesterday. I'm a busy high school girl in the prime of her youth.

09:31.800 --> 09:38.550
But you see, the suspect who ruined the paintings was Yamakawa himself. He was possessed by a Demon--

09:38.550 --> 09:42.260
You say "Demon." Don't you know the 21st century is approaching?

09:42.260 --> 09:45.850
What are you saying, Maron? You <i>see </i>me, an Angel.

09:45.850 --> 09:51.440
You may just be a figment of my imagination. As a matter of fact, nobody else can see you.

09:51.440 --> 09:56.610
Geez, although you've been a Kaitou, a Phantom Thief, for a month you don't seem to understand yet.

09:56.610 --> 10:03.370
The only one who can seal the Demons hiding in beautiful things, is you, the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc, Maron.

10:05.370 --> 10:07.920
Who is this Jeanne d'Something, anyway?

10:09.630 --> 10:15.210
Listen, Maron. The Devil's been trying to take over the world for a long, long time...

10:14.300 --> 10:15.210
- Yeah, yeah...

10:15.210 --> 10:19.220
...and has recently found a way to weaken God.

10:19.220 --> 10:20.720
I don't believe it.

10:20.720 --> 10:25.470
The Devil sends Demons to the Human World and lets them hide in beautiful things.

10:25.470 --> 10:26.600
That's amazing.

10:26.600 --> 10:30.980
The Demons ruin the souls of those who see them and think they are beautiful.

10:32.820 --> 10:37.900
Beautiful souls are the source of life for God.

10:38.490 --> 10:43.910
So if you don't prevent this, God will die and so will humankind.

10:45.830 --> 10:47.160
Everything...

10:50.040 --> 10:51.380
...will be gone?

10:54.340 --> 10:56.960
Notice

10:54.340 --> 10:56.960
Don't go away!

10:54.340 --> 10:56.960
I'll return right after these messages!

10:54.340 --> 10:56.960
Kaitou Jeanne

10:57.880 --> 11:00.470
Notice

10:57.880 --> 11:00.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:57.880 --> 11:00.470
Kaitou Jeanne

11:02.640 --> 11:05.720
Maron-chan, there's plenty to eat.

11:05.720 --> 11:06.560
Thanks.

11:06.560 --> 11:09.560
Yeah, it's so fun when Maron-chan eats dinner with us.

11:09.560 --> 11:12.940
Why don't you eat with us every night?

11:12.940 --> 11:14.190
S-Sure...

11:14.190 --> 11:17.940
That's good because you don't eat right.

11:17.940 --> 11:19.570
That's not true.

11:19.570 --> 11:25.450
Hey, Dad. I heard that Kaitou Jeanne sent her notice card to the artist, Yamakawa.

11:26.790 --> 11:30.120
Mi-Miyako, how did you know about that?

11:30.120 --> 11:34.790
Don't underestimate your daughter. I know about everything in the Police Department.

11:34.790 --> 11:36.380
I bet they told her...<i></i>

11:36.630 --> 11:39.920
<i>Fin, you notified them without telling me again.</i>

11:40.550 --> 11:43.340
This time, I'll catch that Kaitou Jeanne!

11:43.340 --> 11:48.640
Miyako, it's not a good idea for a girl like you to go to such a dangerous place.

11:48.640 --> 11:52.560
It's your father's job to catch the thief.

11:52.560 --> 11:53.850
What?!

11:53.850 --> 11:56.150
She's right, Miyako.

11:56.150 --> 11:57.570
Don't butt in!

11:58.480 --> 12:01.450
Please tell her how it is.

12:02.280 --> 12:03.700
Listen, Miyako.

12:03.700 --> 12:06.620
Dad, you're the Chief Detective for the Jeanne case!

12:06.620 --> 12:09.790
As your daughter, why is it wrong to lend you a hand?!

12:09.790 --> 12:12.040
It sounds harmless enough, Miyako, but...

12:12.500 --> 12:16.500
I had a brainstorm about a special trap to catch Jeanne.

12:16.500 --> 12:18.460
A trap? What kind?

12:18.460 --> 12:21.970
It's a secret. I can't tell anyone yet.

12:24.180 --> 12:26.800
No, I can't allow you to do it.

12:26.800 --> 12:28.680
Oh, you're so stubborn.

12:28.680 --> 12:31.060
You're the stubborn one, Miyako.

12:31.060 --> 12:36.520
DAD! Tell Mom that the police also count on me!

12:36.520 --> 12:38.900
I know you want to, but Miyako...

12:38.900 --> 12:41.280
No, I can't allow you to go.

12:41.280 --> 12:43.530
I'll go! I'll definitely go!

12:43.530 --> 12:45.530
- You aren't going.

12:44.490 --> 12:45.530
- DAD!!!

12:45.530 --> 12:47.450
I know you want to, but Miyako...

12:49.700 --> 12:52.750
Hey, Maron! C'mon, Maron...

12:52.750 --> 12:57.460
I was wrong for sending the notice card without telling you about it.

12:57.460 --> 13:03.380
But only you, who received the soul of Jeanne d'Arc, can do this job.

13:07.800 --> 13:12.270
It's hard for me, too! If I don't finish the jobs, I can't be a Full Angel!

13:12.270 --> 13:14.770
It's hard being a Semi-Angel!

13:24.240 --> 13:29.410
Don't you think you need to save the victim, the artist Yamakawa?

13:31.080 --> 13:35.000
If the Demons manage to occupy the world, everything will disappear.

13:36.000 --> 13:38.500
Everything... Disappear...

13:39.540 --> 13:41.710
Even Miyako-chan and her family--

13:41.710 --> 13:44.470
I'll go! I'll do it!

13:44.880 --> 13:47.720
There's nothing I can't do!

13:48.090 --> 13:51.390
Yay! It's tomorrow at 8:00 P.M.

13:57.980 --> 14:00.020
All set in your positions?

14:00.020 --> 14:02.610
It's almost 8 o'clock. Don't blow it.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.400
Harukawa, roger.

14:04.860 --> 14:06.070
Natsuda, roger.

14:06.450 --> 14:07.650
Akita, roger.

14:08.070 --> 14:09.450
Fuyuta, roger.

14:09.450 --> 14:12.990
Miyako found out about the notice from you guys, didn't she?

14:12.990 --> 14:14.120
Eh?

14:14.120 --> 14:15.500
I'll take care of you guys later.

14:16.000 --> 14:17.290
Harukawa, roger.

14:17.540 --> 14:18.960
Natsuda, roger.

14:19.250 --> 14:20.540
Akita, roger.

14:20.960 --> 14:22.340
Fuyuta, roger.

14:23.840 --> 14:27.630
Yamakawa-kun, the grounds are secure. Please don't worry.

14:28.090 --> 14:31.720
She won't steal your masterpiece, "Green Light."

14:33.220 --> 14:34.310
I understand.

14:35.310 --> 14:36.600
I'll leave it to you, then.

14:37.180 --> 14:41.020
Kaitou Jeanne, I'll catch you tonight!

14:45.530 --> 14:48.110
My, my. Miyako looks enthusiastic tonight.

14:48.110 --> 14:49.950
Maron, will you be okay?

14:49.950 --> 14:54.870
There are so many policemen and Miyako-chan set a trap for you...

14:54.870 --> 14:56.580
Who do you think I am?

14:56.580 --> 14:59.540
I'm the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc! Just leave it to me!

14:59.540 --> 15:01.500
I got it! Good luck!

15:01.500 --> 15:04.340
It's 8:00 sharp. Let's go, Fin.

15:04.340 --> 15:05.630
Okay!

15:11.390 --> 15:12.640
Let's go!

15:16.470 --> 15:19.350
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

15:29.990 --> 15:31.740
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

15:31.740 --> 15:33.620
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

15:33.620 --> 15:35.370
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

15:41.290 --> 15:43.040
Rebound Ball, come out!

15:49.800 --> 15:51.050
<i>Game Start!</i>

16:14.110 --> 16:15.120
It's Jeanne!

16:15.990 --> 16:18.200
Kaitou Jeanne has appeared!

16:18.200 --> 16:19.290
Roger.

16:19.290 --> 16:22.870
Now, Jeanne, see if you can make it here.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.890
She's made it through Point B!

16:46.400 --> 16:48.400
This is the kind of trap she'd come up with.

16:52.280 --> 16:54.780
Miyako's traps are pretty ineffective.

16:55.240 --> 16:58.200
Jeanne's made it through Point C!

17:19.010 --> 17:21.470
Jeanne has passed Point D...

17:22.640 --> 17:25.850
Jeanne, the real game starts now.

17:25.850 --> 17:27.440
The real game starts now...

17:27.440 --> 17:29.150
- Jeanne are you okay?

17:29.900 --> 17:32.360
Fin, so far, so good.

17:32.360 --> 17:34.570
The Demon is in the upstairs studio.

17:35.030 --> 17:36.030
Gotcha.

17:51.590 --> 17:54.300
Kaitou Jeanne, now you have to surrender!

18:01.680 --> 18:05.230
Jeanne has entered the house! Is "that" ready?

18:05.230 --> 18:06.020
Yes!

18:06.020 --> 18:08.230
We'll do it as planned!

18:08.230 --> 18:09.190
Roger!

18:09.940 --> 18:13.230
Hey, did you guys plan something without me?

18:28.370 --> 18:29.540
Okay!

18:30.040 --> 18:31.710
Yes! The plan was successful!

18:33.380 --> 18:35.630
Kaitou Jeanne, you're under arrest...

18:35.630 --> 18:37.920
Huh? Where is she?

18:41.470 --> 18:42.470
Sorry!

18:47.730 --> 18:50.400
Jeanne, this doesn't mean it's over!

18:50.400 --> 18:52.230
I didn't get a chance to show off...

19:01.370 --> 19:02.700
The Demon is in there.

19:09.080 --> 19:10.420
In the name of God...

19:46.030 --> 19:50.540
<i>If the Demons occupy the world, everything will disappear.</i>

19:55.840 --> 19:58.130
I don't want to be alone!

20:04.720 --> 20:06.260
In the name of God...

20:09.560 --> 20:11.940
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:13.020 --> 20:14.900
I seal you here!

20:17.360 --> 20:18.900
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:45.220 --> 20:46.600
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:50.390 --> 20:51.770
The painting was stolen again?!

20:51.770 --> 20:52.810
Yamakawa-kun!

20:53.310 --> 20:54.060
Jeanne!

20:55.850 --> 20:57.110
Adieu!

20:59.020 --> 21:00.570
I won't let you get away!

21:05.570 --> 21:08.700
This is the secret weapon: Miyako Special, Part One!

21:08.700 --> 21:09.700
This is bad!

21:10.950 --> 21:12.120
Just kidding!

21:24.380 --> 21:28.640
Tonight, I've once again stolen a deceptive beauty!

21:38.480 --> 21:39.190
Eh?

21:39.190 --> 21:41.360
Yamakawa-kun...

21:41.360 --> 21:43.150
What was I doing?

21:43.690 --> 21:46.150
Oh, my painting!

21:46.150 --> 21:52.080
Kaitou Jeanne, I'm going to catch you next time!

21:58.500 --> 22:01.960
As I thought, that's her... Kusakabe Maron...

22:05.380 --> 22:11.220
For billions of years,

22:11.300 --> 22:20.770
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:22.940 --> 22:29.410
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.660 --> 22:35.700
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.330 --> 22:39.120
The huge mountains...

22:41.840 --> 22:48.760
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.260 --> 22:53.810
It took everything.

22:56.060 --> 23:02.020
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.110 --> 23:09.030
we watched the world ending...

23:09.240 --> 23:15.120
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.240 --> 23:24.880
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:31.680 --> 23:35.100
No kidding... That guy from yesterday was your boyfriend?!

23:35.100 --> 23:37.770
I'm so jealous that you get to hang out with him at school.

23:37.770 --> 23:39.350
Well... Miyako's so excited, but...

23:39.350 --> 23:43.610
...the guy who transferred from some other school, Nagoya Chiaki, is actually a SUPER playboy.

23:43.610 --> 23:45.650
What the hell is he thinking?

23:45.650 --> 23:49.690
In addition, it's the Demon's fault that the girl feels sad.

23:49.690 --> 23:52.950
I definitely can't accept that...

23:52.950 --> 23:56.740
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: The Target Is the Family Bond

23:57.490 --> 23:59.960
<i>Checkmate!</i> To your heart!
